F11|I/O|PA2||ADC4_IN7 COMP1_INP LPUART1_TX:8 PWR_WKUP4 RCC_LSCO SAI1_D1:3 TIM16_CH1:14 TIM1_BKIN:1 TIM3_CH1:2 TSC_G4_IO4:9 USART1_DE:7 USART1_RTS:7 GPIO
F13|I/O|PA5||ADC4_IN4 AUDIOCLK:13 LPTIM2_ETR:14 PWR_CSLEEP:0 PWR_WKUP6 SAI1_D2:3 SPI3_NSS:6 TIM2_CH1:1 TIM2_ETR:2 TSC_G1_IO4:9 USART1_CK:7 GPIO
